{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "1af08cfa-a7b6-839e-8d42-038246ec915d",
  "created_at": "2026-02-11T11:25:11-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Zoning and Inspections",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Anh Singh",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Anita Chaudhry",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:22:38-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zoning and Inspections, this is Anita. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:22:43-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yes, hello. Sure, thanks for taking my call. I'm putting up a fence and I'm trying to figure out if I need a permit for it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:22:53-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Generally a fence does need a permit here, but let me ask a few things. What kind of fence, and how tall?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:23:01-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Chain-link. Five feet tall. Absolutely, five feet, I measured it in the, um, in the catalog."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:23:07-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Alright. And is your house on a corner, or mid-block? Where it sits on the lot matters."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:23:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, it's a corner lot. Of course. Does that, um, do sight lines matter? I heard something about sight lines but I don't really know what that means."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:23:23-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It can matter, yes. On a corner, the city doesn't want a fence blocking a driver's view of the intersection. Chain-link is open, which helps, but the reviewer will still look at how close it goes to the corner. You'd show where the fence runs on a plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:23:39-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, sure. A plan. Okay. So, do I need a survey for that? Like a real survey?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:23:45-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A survey is often helpful so you know exactly where your property line is. Whether the application requires one, I'd want to confirm with the inspector. I can have someone call you back on that part. For now, a site sketch with the fence marked is usually the starting point."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:24:02-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, yes. A sketch, okay. And, um, the contractor, does he pull the permit or do I? Because I thought maybe he does it, but my brother-in-law said the owner does."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:24:13-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Either can, actually. Many contractors will apply for you, but the owner is responsible for the fence being legal. So ask him up front, and get it in writing."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:24:23-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, sure. So he might, or I might. Wait, so who signs, then?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:24:28-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "If he applies, he signs as the contractor and you'd authorize it as the owner. If you apply, you sign yourself. Either way it ends up with your name on it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:24:39-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, of course. Okay. Can I give you my number for the callback about the survey? I'm writing everything in my address book. Paper one. I don't trust my phone with anything, so."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:24:50-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, go ahead. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:24:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Anh Singh. A-N-H. The number is 401-555-0153."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:24:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Got it, 401-555-0153. I'll have an inspector call you today or tomorrow about the survey and the corner."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:25:03-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely. Thank you. So permit yes, sketch, maybe survey. I think I have it. Mostly."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-11T11:25:09-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's it. Talk soon."
    }
  ],
